---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Rough at Sea, a personal logbook for ideas, deep dives, and useful discoveries."
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <header class="about-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">About this logbook</p>
      <h1>Rough at Sea</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Rough at Sea is a place for ideas worth holding onto: long-form notes, practical
        explainers, strange discoveries, and useful links that deserve a home outside an
        algorithmic feed.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-sections">
      <section>
        <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
        <p>
          The subjects change with the current—software, artificial intelligence, games,
          books, science, medicine, music, and whatever else proves difficult to stop thinking
          about. The common thread is curiosity rather than a single niche.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Why “Rough at Sea”?</h2>
        <!-- Replace this paragraph with the story behind the site's name. -->
        <p class="placeholder">
          [Use this space to explain what the name means to you, where it came from, and why it
          fits the kind of work you want to make.]
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>About the author</h2>
        <!-- Replace this paragraph with your preferred public biography. -->
        <p class="placeholder">
          [Introduce yourself here. A few sentences about who you are, what you work on, and
          the questions or projects that keep pulling you back would be plenty.]
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact and elsewhere</h2>
        <!-- Add only the contact methods and profiles you want to make public. -->
        <p class="placeholder">
          [Add an email address, social profile, YouTube channel, or any other place where
          readers can find your work.]
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .about-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .about-header::after {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff1493, #93ff14, #1493ff);
    bottom: -2px;
    content: '';
    height: 3px;
    left: 0;
    position: absolute;
    width: 7rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--link-color);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 4.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .lede {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .about-sections {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }
  section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }
  section p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .placeholder {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--border-color);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-style: italic;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }
</style>
